WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.602
Welcome to this course. Today we learn how dubbing works.

2
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:11.157
The video stays muted, and a separate audio track plays in sync.

3
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.176
You can switch the language at any time.

4
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:22.773
The picture does not change, only the voice. Thank you!
